  "rationale": "67 units of Cream Bun 400G at Outlet 04 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-15; doing nothing writes off ₹2835 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹2014. This play uses a bundle with SKU-BUTTER-400G at ₹97 for 334 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Personal care regulars, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 32 units, margin ₹276, discount cost ₹416, waste avoided ₹1355 (CI 2 to 93 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" We propose a bundle of Cream Bun 400G with Butter 400G at a bundle price of 97 INR, which satisfies the 8% margin floor for bakery products. This bundle is preferred by the policy over markdowns and is expected to recover 276.01 INR in margin while avoiding 1355.09 INR in waste.",
